   "text": "function.py: global Filter\n\ninlet: plugin_ensure() keeps the tool installed\noutlet: finds the artifact marker in the tool result,\nappends an ```html <iframe> block, once per chat\n\nroutes /excalidraw/*\nGET /view/{chat_id}: signed in + WritableChat → page + token\nGET | POST /api/scenes/{chat_id}: ?t= chat-bound token, CORS *",
   "originalText": "function.py: global Filter\n\ninlet: plugin_ensure() keeps the tool installed\noutlet: finds the artifact marker in the tool result,\nappends an ```html <iframe> block, once per chat\n\nroutes /excalidraw/*\nGET /view/{chat_id}: signed in + WritableChat → page + token\nGET | POST /api/scenes/{chat_id}: ?t= chat-bound token, CORS *",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "func",
